      "es": "Por lo que sé, los navajos no tienen una palabra común para el cero. do-neh-lini significa 'neutral'.",
      "en": "As far as I know, Navajo does not have a common word for zero. do-neh-lini means “neutral.”",
      "noteEn": "The title text questions the literal vocabulary used in the joke; it is separate from the printed dialogue."
